{"parentUuid":"27a792e5-eddb-49a5-ba42-49378a01d24f","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"a1928f48b7b20e826","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfWm3QGeKZeFNv1qCNwMU","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5559,"cache_read_input_tokens":20168,"output_tokens":1667,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":1167},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":5559},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1667,"cache_read_input_tokens":20168,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5559,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":5559,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CfWm3PpMvUXN67NXzL3B4","attributionAgent":"general-purpose","attributionSkill":"code-review","type":"assistant","uuid":"dafb48e7-555e-4a99-843e-9e5d9159b8b5","timestamp":"2026-09-29T00:10:27.983Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"max","perTurnEffort":"max","userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-cli","cwd":"/tmp/tmp.Gfz5zxUZc1/target/.worktrees/T-1-rev-bug-opus","sessionId":"d6258ad3-7090-4f6d-bc58-85b4f7e82e0f","version":"2.1.284","gitBranch":"HEAD"}
{"parentUuid":"dafb48e7-555e-4a99-843e-9e5d9159b8b5","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"a1928f48b7b20e826","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfWm3QGeKZeFNv1qCNwMU","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"```json\n[\n  {\n    \"file\": \"src/count.js\",\n    \"line\": 5,\n    \"summary\": \"The size check in pageCount copies the one in page (src/page.js:6) word for word, and page.js:5 repeats the same positive-integer check for `number`; all three should call one shared helper, for example a `positiveInteger(name, value)`, or pageCount should move into page.js next to page so both use one check.\",\n    \"failure_scenario\": \"The rule for a valid page size and its error text now live in two modules. If one copy changes, for example page gets a maximum size or one side starts accepting a numeric string from a query parameter, page and pageCount will disagree on which sizes are valid. A caller that runs `for (n = 1; n <= pageCount(size); n++) page(n, size)` then throws partway through, or pageCount rejects a size that page accepts, and every rule change has to be made and tested twice.\"\n  }\n]\n```\n\nNotes: The repo has no shared or utility module, and store.js has no read-only count (`add` returns the count only when it adds a record). So `all().length` in count.js:6 has no existing helper to reuse; copying the whole array just to read its length is a point for the efficiency angle, not this one. Outside my angle, I confirmed with node that page.js:8 slices to `start + size + 1`. With records a to e and size 2, pages 1..pageCount(2) come back as [\"a\",\"b\",\"c\"], [\"c\",\"d\",\"e\"], [\"e\"], so pages overlap, hold size+1 records, and disagree with pageCount."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5559,"cache_read_input_tokens":20168,"output_tokens":1667,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":1167},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":5559},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1667,"cache_read_input_tokens":20168,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5559,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":5559,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CfWm3PpMvUXN67NXzL3B4","attributionAgent":"general-purpose","attributionSkill":"code-review","type":"assistant","uuid":"f39148e3-403a-483b-8297-546f81135c6c","timestamp":"2026-09-29T00:10:27.993Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"max","perTurnEffort":"max","userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-cli","cwd":"/tmp/tmp.Gfz5zxUZc1/target/.worktrees/T-1-rev-bug-opus","sessionId":"d6258ad3-7090-4f6d-bc58-85b4f7e82e0f","version":"2.1.284","gitBranch":"HEAD"}
